87000.000124"}}
{"seq":17,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/claude-code-opus-none-mu-v03-dev2/sy-02-marrow-fieldworks-ticket-numbers/r4","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T08:30:59.621Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"aa2d86f7ccd5ee28eb979945f81d2df92f4944239a7175d2a2f217875f39a617","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","text":"I replied to Tobias in his DM with three Marrow Fieldworks ticket numbers. None of the sources names the account right next to a ticket number, so all three are my best reading rather than confirmed.\n\n- **#4409**: a recurring report timeout at the Salina North yard.\n- **#4412**: a glitch in the driver text-message prompt.\n  - Both come from Moss's Central handoffs digest (2 Jan 2026). It lists them as the two open tickets Hollis flagged on \"Pree's dealer account\" just before Marrow Fieldworks changed hands on 5 Jan.\n- **#8841**: Door 2 at the west yard double-booking, from #central-random on 13 Oct. Tobias flagged it in reply to Hollis asking about \"Tobias's dealer account.\" I counted it because Marrow Fieldworks appears to be the dealer account that came to him in that handoff.\n\nI left out two things:\n- **FR-882**: it's logged under Marrow Agrisupply, a separate account, and it's a feature request rather than a support ticket.\n- **Moss's Central cheat sheet**: it only says \"door 4 msg\" under Marrow Agrisupply, with no ticket number.\n\nTobias is a member of #central-random, so I only read sources he can see himself, and I didn't use message search. There are no files in Moss's own notes folder, and I couldn't see any Marrow Fieldworks account files. That means I couldn't check whether these tickets are still open, and I told him so."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DHARNES0001","ts":"1791987000.000125"}}
